# Local copy of binji/wasm-clang toolchain (60MB), hosted on
# wasm.naranjositos.tech/toolchain/ — see docs/wasm-cc.md
# Ignore the heavy binaries / vendored sources individually so our own
# ositok.h next to them stays tracked.
